# Files that never ship and never change what Pyrelands does (modcheck/status.py mod_hash): the human-review map's
# key sheet, coverage table and selftest (human_review.py itself is excluded by basename). Lists itself so adding it
# leaves the hash unchanged. The walk_small selftest is offline: it never ships, and its edit reruns no live check.
.hashignore
review/
selftest_pyrelands_walk_small.py
